    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40546" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕceptātor</span></b> ,
			ōris, m.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				receiver</i>, <i>shelterer;</i> in a bad sense,
				<i>a hider</i>, <i>harborer</i>, <i>concealer</i> (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(Rhenus) receptator hostium atque defensor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					3, 10, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">de receptatoribus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					47, 16</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">1, 15, 3</span></i>;
			cf. receptor.</div>
